Brand Assets Exception / 品牌资产除外声明

The MIT license above covers the code, documentation, templates and pipeline
of this repository, EXCEPT the following brand assets:

  - assets/character.svg — the "Interflow" IP mascot artwork
  - the "Interflow" name and visual identity

These brand assets remain (c) Derek Lee, all rights reserved. You MAY keep
them as the default configuration when producing videos with this skill.
You may NOT redistribute them as standalone assets, use them as your own
brand / IP identity, or imply official affiliation. For a fully-yours build,
replace assets/character.svg with your own mascot (node contract in README).

上述 MIT 许可覆盖本仓库的代码、文档、模板与管线，但**不包括**以下品牌资产：
assets/character.svg（Interflow IP 小人形象）以及 "Interflow" 名称与视觉识别。
品牌资产保留所有权利：允许在使用本 skill 出片时按默认配置使用；不得将其单独
抽出再分发、不得用作你自己的品牌 / IP 标识、不得暗示官方关联。想要完全属于
你的版本，请按 README 的节点契约替换 assets/character.svg 为你自己的小人形象。
